  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Join Loops Lab and help families discover a screen-free music creation experience. Earn competitive commissions promoting an innovative gadget that combines creativity, music, and hands-on play.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">•<strong> About our brand and products:</strong> Loops Lab is unlike any other kids’ brand. We transform music creation into a hands-on adventure powered by play. Our smart stage and collectible characters let kids create real music simply by placing and combining figurines (no screens or musical training required). Each character represents unique sounds, loops, and effects, allowing kids to create endless musical combinations.<br style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(17,24,39);font-family:Inter;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);color:rgb(17,24,39);font-family:Inter;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong>• What makes us different: </strong>Loops Lab combines physical play with music creation in a way that feels like magic. Kids aren’t simply pressing buttons, they’re composing, experimenting, and expressing themselves through a tactile experience that encourages creativity and confidence. Our platform delivers studio-quality sound and real-time interaction, turning every play session into a unique musical experience.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>• How affiliates can earn: </strong>Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every qualifying sale generated through their unique links. We provide opportunities for both open collaborations and targeted partnerships, giving partners multiple ways to grow their earnings while sharing products they genuinely enjoy.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>• How to promote us:</strong> Loops Lab performs especially well through authentic content including unboxings, build challenges, demonstrations, family activities, educational content, STEM projects, gift guides, and creative videos. We encourage affiliates to showcase their own building experiences and inspire their audiences to create.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>• Other information: </strong>We value long-term partnerships and actively support our affiliates with promotional opportunities, product launches, seasonal campaigns, and exclusive collaboration opportunities. Whether you're a creator, educator, family influencer, or content publisher, we'd love to build together.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
